id\u2019s energetic soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross-platform play between PC and Nintendo Switch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player campaign to uncover the secrets of Prison Island</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete Pritto Challenges to earn Pritto Coins and unlock decorations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your animals and robots with a variety of fun decorations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Host private matches with your friends using custom settings</p></li></ul>","developers":["PinCool"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036800/5bfff9fc357c1a3758ce918a0255960ca45d1f03/header.jpg?t=1761240603","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12.6 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i3 10th generation or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Iris Plus or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5.1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3036800/1034465224/8b48a8d0bbff759fa43f59c8e0c7750783881706/1760210266/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760210718","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3036800/1034465224/8b48a8d0bbff759fa43f59c8e0c7750783881706/1760210266/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760210718","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3036800/1034465224/8b48a8d0bbff759fa43f59c8e0c7750783881706/1760210266/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760210718","id":257216170,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257216170/movie480.mp4?t=1760210718","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257216170